<title>USA: TABLE - Boston Edison Co Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Boston Edison Co Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p> 3 months ended June 30:	 1997		1996  % Change</p>
<p> Operating revenues	  $   426,735    $   389,756    9.5%</p>
<p> Net income			   33,978	   27,926   21.7%</p>
<p> Earnings per share		   0.63	     0.50   26.0%</p>
<p> Weighted average # of shares   48,515	   48,194    0.7%</p>
<p> 12 months ended June 30:	  1997	   1996   % Change</p>
<p> Operating revenues	  $ 1,738,158  $ 1,645,601	5.6%</p>
<p> Net income			  143,331   119,101(a)     20.3%</p>
<p> Earnings per share		   2.65	2.17(a)     22.1%</p>
